#: inc/admin-settings-page.php:1245
#, php-format
msgid "A focused control has to be visible — %1$sWCAG \"Focus Visible\" (2.4.7, Level AA)%2$s — and %3$s\"Focus Appearance\" (2.4.13, Level AAA)%4$s sets how big the mark must be. AWT meets both whichever way you set this. One outline is simply easier to measure than Carbon's three overlapping layers."
